{"asks":[{"quote":"If you disagree, say so and I'll add it under Appearance.","question":"Should the activity strip have an Appearance preference?","kind":"decision","options":["No preference","Add preference"]},{"quote":"Do you want Strata to normalize these, for example always showing \"Explore: search for tests\" style labels, or should it show what the provider sent?","question":"How should Strata display subagent labels?","kind":"decision","options":["Normalize labels","Show provider labels"]},{"quote":"Tell me which you'd rather see and I'll do that one.","question":"Where should completed subagent activity appear?","kind":"decision","options":["Under the message","In the Trace drawer"]},{"quote":"Is eight the right number, or would you rather it show everything and scroll?","question":"How many subagent rows should the strip display?","kind":"decision","options":["Cap at eight","Show all with scrolling"]},{"quote":"Is that enough, or do you want the error inline?","question":"Should subagent error text appear inline in the activity strip?","kind":"decision","options":["Trace only","Show error inline"]},{"quote":"The elapsed timer stops when T3 reports completion, not when the parent turn ends. That means a subagent that finished early keeps showing its own short time.","question":"Should each subagent timer stop when that subagent completes?","kind":"question","options":[]},{"quote":"I can add it back if it's useful to you.","question":"Should the activity strip show token usage for each subagent?","kind":"decision","options":["Leave it out","Show per-subagent usage"]},{"quote":"Let me know if you'd rather I hold this until the link-opening change lands, since both touch the Conversation panel and there's a small merge risk in the message component.","question":"Should this work wait until the link-opening change lands?","kind":"decision","options":["Continue now","Wait for link-opening change"]}]}
